{{HDB}}
==Format==
<section begin="Format"/>
* '''Winners Bracket - Round 1:''' 
** The 40 teams are spread into 2 groups of 20 and will play in 1 {{Abbr/MatchSeries/6}}.
*** {{bgcolortext|up|Top 10 teams}} of the stage will advance to ''Winners Bracket Round 2''.
*** {{bgcolortext|staydown|Bottom 10 teams}} of the stage will advance to the ''Losers Bracket - Round 1''.
* '''Winners Bracket - Round 2:''' 
** The top 20 teams from ''Group Stage'' will play in 1 {{Abbr/MatchSeries/6}}.
*** {{bgcolortext|up|Top 10 teams}} of the stage advance to the ''[[Apex Legends Global Series/2024/Championship/Last Chance Qualifier/EMEA/Finals|Finals]]''.
*** {{bgcolortext|staydown|Bottom 10 teams}} of the stage will advance to the ''Losers Bracket - Round 2''.
* '''Losers Bracket - Round 1:''' 
** The 20 teams will play in 1 {{Abbr/MatchSeries/6}}.
*** {{bgcolortext|stayup|Top 10 teams}} of the stage will advance to the ''Losers Bracket - Round 2''.
*** {{bgcolortext|down|Bottom 10 teams}} of the stage will be eliminated from the tournament.
* '''Losers Bracket - Round 2:'''
** The 20 teams will play in 1 {{Abbr/MatchSeries/6}}.
*** {{bgcolortext|up|Top 10 teams}} of the stage will advance to the ''[[Apex Legends Global Series/2024/Championship/Last Chance Qualifier/EMEA/Finals|Finals]]''.
*** {{bgcolortext|down|Bottom 10 teams}} of the stage will be eliminated from the tournament.
<section end="Format"/>

